TITLE:: RCSubseq
summary:: One resolved subsequence of a rhythm
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCRhythmDict, Classes/RCSubseqLibrary, Classes/RCCrawlerMoves

DESCRIPTION::
The proto-library passed these as 8-slot arrays; the fields are named here but code::at(i):: / code::put(i, v):: keep the indices: 0 priority, 1 shift, 2 durs, 3 params, 4 mask, 5 name, 6 keysIgnoreOrder, 7 timeMult. Equality and hash are structural so subseqs can live in Bags and Sets.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: new
METHOD:: fromArray

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: priority
METHOD:: shift
METHOD:: durs
Array of durations (numbers / Rests) or a Pattern.
METHOD:: params
Event key → Array (one value per hit) or Pattern.
METHOD:: mask
Array of Booleans or a Pattern.
METHOD:: name
METHOD:: keysIgnoreOrder
METHOD:: timeMult
METHOD:: isArraySeq
METHOD:: numHits
METHOD:: asArray
